{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7297b75f-a6f7-4d3a-a551-eaaa584520a5",
    "name": "PDA (RollTrack) - tested",
    "description": "RollTrack PDA endpoints on the ORDS module \"PDA\", verified live on 2026-11-18 and 2026-11-23.\n\nBase URL uses the ORDS schema alias **snym_erp** (the APEX workspace name xact_erp is NOT part of the API URL; xact_erp/api/... returns 404).\n\nBefore use: set the collection variable `userPassword` (left empty on purpose, never commit it).\n\nNote: load, unload and sub-contract-issue reach the server and answer SUCCESS, but their procedures (TAGGING_RFID_TO_LOAD / _UNLOAD / _ROLL) are placeholders that save nothing yet. ref-weight is not included because it has not been tested.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "19491507"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://118.179.223.40:7007/ords/snym_erp/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userName", "value": "Sumon", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userPassword", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refCodeNo", "value": "BPKWL-13/IR25060017", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refId", "value": "38", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. pda-login",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "inherit" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pda-login?USER_NAME={{userName}}&USER_PASSWORD={{userPassword}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["pda-login"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "USER_NAME", "value": "{{userName}}" },
            { "key": "USER_PASSWORD", "value": "{{userPassword}}", "description": "URL-encode special characters, e.g. # becomes %23" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Login. Returns the USER_ID used by every other call."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Success",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pda-login?USER_NAME={{userName}}&USER_PASSWORD={{userPassword}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["pda-login"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "USER_NAME", "value": "{{userName}}" },
                { "key": "USER_PASSWORD", "value": "{{userPassword}}" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"status\":\"SUCCESS\"\n,\"USER_ID\":1\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. req-scan (look up request)",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "inherit" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/req-scan?USER_ID={{userId}}&REF_CODE_NO={{refCodeNo}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["req-scan"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "USER_ID", "value": "{{userId}}" },
            { "key": "REF_CODE_NO", "value": "{{refCodeNo}}", "description": "Requisition number (YRN_PRC_REQUISITIONS.REQ_NO). Not a work-order or roll number." }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Read-only. Finds the requisition by REQ_NO and returns its numeric REF_ID for sub-contract-issue. NO_OF_ITEMS is currently hard-coded to 10 on the server."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Found",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/req-scan?USER_ID={{userId}}&REF_CODE_NO={{refCodeNo}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["req-scan"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "USER_ID", "value": "{{userId}}" },
                { "key": "REF_CODE_NO", "value": "{{refCodeNo}}" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"status\":\"SUCCESS\"\n,\"REF_ID\":38\n,\"NO_OF_ITEMS\":10\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Not found",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/req-scan?USER_ID={{userId}}&REF_CODE_NO=WO-W260700198",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["req-scan"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "USER_ID", "value": "{{userId}}" },
                { "key": "REF_CODE_NO", "value": "WO-W260700198" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"error\":\"ORA-01403: no data found\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. sub-contract-issue (Tag Issue)",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "inherit" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"REF_ID\": \"{{refId}}\",\n  \"USER_ID\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\", \"E2806A960000502D1EB05952\"]\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/sub-contract-issue",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["sub-contract-issue"]
        },
        "description": "Corrected path: snym_erp (the old xact_erp path returns 404). REF_ID must be the numeric id from req-scan; a non-numeric REF_ID makes the server answer \"User ID not found\". Calls TAGGING_RFID_TO_ROLL, which is a placeholder (saves nothing yet)."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Accepted",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"REF_ID\": \"38\",\n  \"USER_ID\": \"1\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\", \"E2806A960000502D1EB05952\"]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/sub-contract-issue", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["sub-contract-issue"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"status\":\"SUCCESS\"\n,\"message\":\"QR Code 38 tagged to 2 item(s)\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. load (Loading)",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "inherit" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"USER_ID\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\", \"E2806A960000502D1EB05952\"]\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/load",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["load"]
        },
        "description": "Marks rolls as loaded. ITEMS = roll tag IDs. Calls TAGGING_RFID_TO_LOAD, which is a placeholder (saves nothing yet)."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Accepted",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"USER_ID\": \"1\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\", \"E2806A960000502D1EB05952\"]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/load", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["load"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"status\":\"SUCCESS\"\n,\"message\":\"2 item(s)\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. unload (Unloading)",
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "inherit" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"USER_ID\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\", \"E2806A960000502D1EB05952\"]\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/unload",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["unload"]
        },
        "description": "Marks rolls as unloaded. ITEMS = roll tag IDs. Calls TAGGING_RFID_TO_UNLOAD, which is a placeholder (saves nothing yet)."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Accepted",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"USER_ID\": \"1\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\", \"E2806A960000502D1EB05952\"]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/unload", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["unload"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"status\":\"SUCCESS\"\n,\"message\":\"2 item(s)\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Missing USER_ID",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"USER_ID\": \"\",\n  \"ITEMS\": [\"E2806A960000402D1EB05D2F\"]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/unload", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["unload"] }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n\"status\":\"ERROR\"\n,\"message\":\"User ID not found\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
